    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Translator Text now supports the Odia, Dari, Pashto, Central Kurdish and Northern Kurdish languages. Learn more about these language releases by reading our blog:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://aka.ms/TranslatorOdiaBlog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Odia</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://aka.ms/TranslatorDariPashtoBlog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dari &amp; Pashto</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://aka.ms/TranslatorKurdishBlog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Central and Northern Kurdish</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>See&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/Translator/language-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">more information</a>&nbsp;on other languages that Translator supports.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Translator Text now supports the Odia, Dari, Pashto, Central Kurdish and Northern Kurdish languages. Learn more about these language releases by reading our blog:\n\nOdia\n\nDari & Pashto\n\nCentral and Northern Kurdish\n\nSee more information on other languages that Translator supports."
